\ row.ga - a word passed along row 6, gaining 1 at each node, then to node
\ 708 to send, with code in corners of the chip so that the boot reaches
\ them
\ expect: 0x2a

node 600
: main east b! 1 !b warm
node 601
: main west a! east b! @ 1 + !b warm
node 602
: main west a! east b! @ 1 + !b warm
node 603
: main west a! east b! @ 1 + !b warm
node 604
: main west a! east b! @ 1 + !b warm
node 605
: main west a! east b! @ 1 + !b warm
node 606
: main west a! east b! @ 1 + !b warm
node 607
: main west a! east b! @ 1 + !b warm
node 608
: main west a! north b! @ 34 + !b warm
node 708
include serial.ga
: main south a! io b! @ send done warm
node 0
: double ( n - n ) 2* ;
: main 21 double warm
node 17
: main 0x3ffff warm
node 717
: main 717 warm
